### Smart Home API Tests
### Используйте расширение REST Client для выполнения запросов

### ============================================
### Sensor Management Service (Port 8080)
### ============================================

### Get all sensors
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sensors

### Get sensor by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sensors/1

### Create sensor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sensors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Living Room Temperature",
  "type": "temperature",
  "location": "Living Room",
  "unit": "Celsius"
}

### Update sensor
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sensors/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Sensor Name",
  "location": "Bedroom"
}

### Update sensor value
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sensors/1/value
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 22.5,
  "status": "active"
}

### Get temperature by location
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sensors/temperature/Living%20Room

### Delete sensor
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sensors/1

### ============================================
### Telemetry Service (Port 8082)
### ============================================

### Get telemetry by sensor ID
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/telemetry/sensors/1

### Get telemetry history
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/telemetry/sensors/1/history?limit=10

### Get telemetry history with date range
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/telemetry/sensors/1/history?from=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2024-12-31T23:59:59Z&limit=100

### Collect telemetry
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/telemetry/collect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sensor_ids": [1, 2, 3]
}

### ============================================
### Device Management Service (Port 8083)
### ============================================

### Get all devices
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/devices

### Get device by ID
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/devices/1

### Create device
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smart Thermostat",
  "type": "thermostat",
  "location": "Living Room",
  "configuration": {
    "target_temperature": 22,
    "mode": "auto"
  }
}

### Update device
PUT http://localhost:8083/api/v1/devices/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Device Name",
  "location": "Bedroom",
  "configuration": {
    "target_temperature": 23
  }
}

### Update device state
PATCH http://localhost:8083/api/v1/devices/1/state
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "on",
  "reason": "User activated"
}

### Delete device
DELETE http://localhost:8083/api/v1/devices/1

### ============================================
### Temperature API (Port 8081)
### ============================================

### Get temperature by location
GET http://localhost:8081/temperature?location=Living%20Room

### Get temperature by sensor ID
GET http://localhost:8081/temperature/1


